\f1\fs20\lang1027\langfe3082\cgrid\langnp1027\langfenp3082 {\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof $ Base de datos de informes}}K{\footnote \pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 
